{"t":"Plague Spike","s":"plague-spike-2ab7e","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Plague Spike</b> is the aptly-named mountain range separating the <a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer%20%28Geography%29\">Devourer</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>. It is known by many names, including <b>Mountain of Poison</b> and <b>Scorpions Rock</b>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1332px;left:-1185px;clip:rect(1332px 1441px 1588px 1185px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"2560\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33057,32436,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33057, 32436, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p>All throughout the Plague Spike are poisonous creatures, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena\">Hyaenas</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomads</a>.\n</p><p>Just on the western side of the mountains is <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, the hide-out of a horde of <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">undead</a> and a cult of necromancers.\n</p></div>","quests":["nightmare-isles-mini-world-change","nightmare-teddy-quest","what-a-foolish-quest"]}